    function f_lj(a:{ a:int, b:int, c:int, d:int, e:int, f:int, g:int, h:int, i:int, j:int, k:int, l:int, m:int, n:int, o:int, p:int }) { // func271
you can find encryptFunc by going to the t.send imported function and seeing what its callees. go to the first one connected to it thats not the bigFunc. then, right next to the t.send function in the call graph will be the encryptFunc.
